Steps:
1. Send a POST request to /api/orders with the payload in testData using the JWT token of the shop owner. 2. Verify the response status and body.

Test Data: {
  "shopId": 1,
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "customerPhone": "1234567890",
  "customerGender": "MALE",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 1,
      "measurementGroups": [
        {
          "specialInstruction": "Urgent tailoring",
          "measurements": [
            {
              "nameEn": "Collar Size",
              "nameBn": "কলার সাইজ",
              "unit": "inch",
              "type": "NUMBER",
              "value": "15.5"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

Expected Result:
HTTP 200 OK response with a JSON body containing: {
  "status": "success",
  "message": "Order created successfully",
  "data": {
    "orderId": "<non-null string>",
    "customerName": "John Doe"
  }
}

