Steps:
1. Send a GET request to /api/shops/{shopId}/workers with the Authorization header containing 'Bearer <valid-jwt-token>'. Use shopId owned by the user.
2. Send a POST request to /api/orders with the payload in testData and the same Authorization header.

Test Data: {
  "shopId": 1,
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "customerPhone": "+1234567890",
  "customerGender": "MALE",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 1,
      "measurementGroups": [
        {
          "measurements": [
            {
              "nsId": "chest",
              "nameEn": "Chest",
              "nameBn": "বুক",
              "unit": "inch",
              "type": "NUMBER",
              "value": "40"
