}

1. Send a POST request to /api/orders with the payload in testData and Authorization header containing 'Bearer <valid-jwt-token>'.
2. Send a PUT request to /api/orders/{orderId} with the payload in testData and the same Authorization header. Use the orderId returned from step 1.
3. Send a POST request to /api/orders with the payload in testData but with shopId set to 2 and the same Authorization header.

Test Data: {
  "shopId": 1,
  "customerName": "Jane Smith",
  "customerPhone": "+1987654321",
  "customerGender": "FEMALE",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 1,
      "measurementGroups": [
        {
          "measurements": [
